// 这是对照表差异项的反馈
VAR choice = 0

    {
        -choice == 1:  
            -> choice_1  
        -choice == 2:  
            -> choice_2 
        -choice == 3:  
            -> choice_3  
        -choice == 4:  
            -> choice_4 
        -choice == 5:  
            -> choice_5
        -choice == 6:  
            -> choice_6
        -choice == 7:  
            -> choice_7
        -choice == 8:  
            -> choice_8
        -choice == 9:  
            -> choice_9
        -choice == 10:  
            -> choice_10
        -choice == 11:  
            -> choice_11
    }  
  
== choice_1
    // 是否提交路引
   You can't remember this symbol either! Hahaha!#Layout:Left
    ->END
  
== choice_2
    // 姓名是否一致
    Uhm? Lord Arbiter please take a closer look?#Layout:Left
    ->END

== choice_3
    // 生辰是否一致
    Birthday is wrong on the travel pass!  #Layout:Right
o, I thought in this world, including myself, <color=red>no one remembers my birthday</color>. The Book of Life and Death is so interesting. Lord Arbiter, follow what the book says then.#Layout:Left
    ->END

== choice_4
    // 生辰八字是否一致
    Lord Arbiter? That night should be the Mid-Autumn Festival.#Layout:Left
    ->END

== choice_5
    // 死期是否一致
    It's the East District.#Layout:Left
    ->END
    
== choice_6
    // 阳寿
    Uhm, Cui Er's travel pass is correct, but one question still remains. Her day of death has arrived, but still has a lot of years of living left. Is it the effect of the Flower of Wangchuan?  #Layout:Right
    ->END
    
== choice_7
It's just a symbol, no need to care.#Layout:Left
    ->END
    
== choice_8
Greetings. Haha!#Layout:Left
    ->END


== choice_9
Uhm? If the date on the Book of Life and Death is really this, that's really destiny. #Layout:Left
    ->END

== choice_10
My day of death is the Mid-Autumn Festival, hahaha, nice, I like it!#Layout:Left
    ->END
    
== choice_11
 After so many comes and goes, I am back here again. Destiny. #Layout:Left
    ->END

->END
